<title>USA: United Dominion, South West sets meeting dates.</title>
<headline>United Dominion, South West sets meeting dates.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Dominion Realty Trust Inc and South West Property Inc said their special shareholder meetings to consider the proposed merger of South West into United Dominion will be held on Tuesday, December 10.</p>
<p>The companies said they expect to distribute a joint proxy statement on or about November 8.</p>
<p>If the transaction is approved, the merger will be effective on or about December 31. Both companies are in the process of performing due diligence and expect the process to be completed by October 31.</p>
</text>
